    "reviews": "\u201cGreat narrative with many possibilities. There is a mysterious hidden plot and I'm curious to see how it unfolds.\u201d<br />\r\nPlayer Review<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cA great game. A very likable, relatable main character. Beautiful renders and an engaging story. I cannot wait to see where it goes. The sky is the limit here. Paloma &lt;3\u201d<br />\r\nPlayer Review<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cThis novel is the best one I have found thus far. The character development is great, the graphics and animation are outstanding. If I could only suggest one novel to get it would be this one hands down.\u201d<br />\r\nPlayer Review<br />\r\n",
